ou start again from the beginning!\n\nUnlock permanent upgrades and new enemies the further you get in the dungeon. How far can you get before you perish?\n\nFeatures:\n\u2605 Infinite procedurally generated dungeons!\n\u2605 Terrifying monsters to battle!\n\u2605 Environmental hazards!\n\u2605 Shop to upgrade abilities during a run!\n\u2605 Permanent upgrades and unlocks that stay between runs!", "short_description": "Did you ever want to feel like a powerful mage as you explore dungeons, fighting scary monsters and discovering long lost treasure?\n\nMythic Mage is a dungeon crawler with procedurally generated levels. Fight monsters using melee or ranged attacks! Face giant bosses! Upgrade your stats between floors! But beware: if you die, you start again from the beginning!\n\nUnlock permanent upgrades and new enemies the further you get in the dungeon. How far can you get before you perish?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/10aIJbCE7sSdmNKTR-5PfX8bTVjyPkZ6BY2cwRRS9wGQ/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Andreas Gr\u00fctter", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/MythicMage", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "821934236779161"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "RPG", "FIGHTING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26208992505413930"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://sconte